    %% COLUMN 2: GATEWAY, ADVISORY AI & DETERMINISTIC POLICY
    %% =========================================================================
    subgraph COL_CORE ["2. Gateway, Advisory AI & Deterministic Governance"]
        direction TB

        GATEWAY["<b>Trust Boundary 1: Bounded Splunk Gateway (gateway/)</b><br/>• gateway/policy.py & gateway/splunk_search.py<br/>• <b>Exact Allowlisted Query Types:</b><br/>  1. encoded_powershell_matches<br/>  2. powershell_network_retrieval_matches<br/>  3. scheduled_task_creation_matches<br/>  4. modsecurity_sqli_matches<br/>• <b>NO arbitrary model-supplied SPL</b>: Raw queries fail closed<br/>• Telemetry treated strictly as untrusted, inert data"]:::detControl

        ORCH["<b>Trust Boundary 2: Advisory AI Investigator (investigator/)</b><br/>• AI Investigator Orchestrator (orchestrator.py, model.py)<br/>• Schema-constrained JSON contracts (schemas.py)<br/>• <b>ADVISORY-ONLY AUTHORITY</b>: Hypotheses & summaries<br/>• <b>ZERO EXECUTION AUTHORITY</b>: Cannot mutate state or run commands"]:::advisoryAi

        ROUTER["<b>Deterministic Tool Router & Guardrails</b><br/>• ToolRouter (tool_router.py): allowlisted tools only<br/>• Unknown tools rejected with <b>TOOL_NOT_FOUND</b><br/>• RuntimeGuard (runtime_guard.py): Max 5 tool call budget<br/>• Irreversible fail-closed latching kill switch"]:::detControl

        POLICY["<b>Trust Boundary 3: Deterministic Policy Authority (policy.py)</b><br/>• <b>Authoritative Risk Scoring (0–100)</b>: Additive evidence facts<br/>• Dispositions: LOW | MEDIUM | HIGH | CRITICAL<br/>• Authoritative MITRE ATT&CK technique catalog mapping<br/>• <b>Model Override Blocked</b>: AI cannot set risk, disposition, or MITRE<br/>• <b>IPv4 Scope Classifier (threat_intel.py)</b>: 8 RFC scopes<br/>  - Private LabNet (192.168.1.x) ──▶ <b>SKIPPED_INELIGIBLE</b> (Zero Leakage)<br/>  - Public IPs ──▶ Bounded VirusTotal REST v3 (+15 cap)"]:::detControl

        GATEWAY -- "Validated Telemetry" --> ORCH
        ORCH <--> ROUTER
        ROUTER -- "Bounded Queries" --> GATEWAY
        ORCH -- "Hypothesis & Action" --> POLICY
    end

    SPLUNK -- "REST Export (:8089)" --> GATEWAY

