    subgraph COL_ACTION ["3. Conditional Action Split & Permitted Simulation"]
        direction TB

        ACTION_DISPATCH["<b>Deterministic Action Policy Engine</b><br/>• Evaluates proposed action against policy disposition<br/>• <b>Strict Conditional Split</b>: Reporting vs. Consequential Actions"]:::detControl

        REPORTING["<b>Non-Consequential / Reporting Path</b><br/>• Actions: create_incident_record, HUMAN_REVIEW<br/>• Informational summaries & downstream tracking<br/>• <b>Does NOT require human approval</b> (reporting sink)<br/>• Jira Incident Ticketing (ticketing.py): Hardened ADF<br/>• Verified tickets: KAN-7, KAN-8/9, KAN-10, KAN-12<br/>• <b>ZERO response authority</b>: Cannot trigger actions"]:::detControl

        APPROVAL_GATE["<b>Trust Boundary 4: Human Approval Gate (Consequential Path)</b><br/>• Consequential Action: simulate_endpoint_isolation<br/>• <b>Mandatory Human Authorization Required</b><br/>• <b>ApprovalRegistry (approval.py)</b>:<br/>  - Exact Triple Binding: (incident_id, action, policy)<br/>  - Bounded Freshness TTL: <b>600 seconds</b><br/>  - Single-use approval consumption<br/>  - Persistent JSONL consumption ledger (approval_consumption.jsonl)<br/>  - Replay rejection with flush+fsync<br/>  - <i>Non-claim: No cross-host/multiprocess atomicity guarantee</i>"]:::humanGate

        SIMULATOR["<b>Trust Boundary 5: Permitted Simulation Boundary</b><br/>• <b>Simulated Response Executor (simulator.py)</b><br/>• <b>REAL ENDPOINT CONTAINMENT: NOT IMPLEMENTED</b><br/>• Flow: AI proposes ──▶ Policy evaluates ──▶ Human approves ──▶ Simulation<br/>• Records simulated action (SIMULATED vs. NOT_EXECUTED)<br/>• Zero real host isolation, zero account disabling, zero firewall changes"]:::simResponse

        ACTION_DISPATCH -- "Non-consequential Action" --> REPORTING
        ACTION_DISPATCH -- "Consequential Action" --> APPROVAL_GATE
        APPROVAL_GATE -- "Authorized Execution" --> SIMULATOR
    end

    POLICY --> ACTION_DISPATCH

